---
description: Always keep Cursor/agent plan markdown files out of git
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ignore plan markdown files

- Never stage or commit Cursor plan files (`*.plan.md`, `.cursor/plans/**`).
- If a new plan file appears in the working tree, ensure it is covered by `.gitignore` instead of adding it.
- Do not edit the plan file when the user says not to; treat plans as local agent artifacts.
- Canonical product/engineering specs under `docs/` (for example blueprints meant for implementation) may still be committed when the user asks — those are not Cursor plan files.
